=2 Walkthrough
!Dangruf Wadi-map1.jpg|right|Dangruf Wadi Map
* Speak to any Bastokan {n:Gate Guard} to accept the Mission.
** {n:Malduc} right beside {p:Naji} will start this Mission.
* Go to **Cid's Lab** at (G-8) in {z:Metalworks} top floor and talk to {p:Cid} for a cutscene. You'll receive the {@k} {k:Blue acidity tester}.
* Head to (D-9) in {z:South Gustaberg} to enter {z:Dangruf Wadi}.
* Once you enter the zone, turn right at the fork and head north to (I-8).
* In the south-east corner of (I-8), stand on the geyser until it pushes you up onto the ledge.
** Check your detector Key Item to make sure that it has changed to a {@k} {k:Red acidity tester}.
* Return to {p:Cid} for a cutscene that finishes the Mission.

